  "disposition": [
    "Retire obsolete ADL monolith Cargo identity demo dispatch and its coupled aggregate/quality runner contracts, not Runtime identity functionality. The public ADL manifest no longer contains that private dispatcher.",
    "Runtime7d0 retains temporal/phi/instinct sources but they still invoke literal Cargo; source correspondence and identity unit proof are not original shell qualification. No fake Cargo shim, binary route substitution or broad build used.",
    "Quality producer drives old monolith fmt/clippy/test/coverage and deleted legacy/skill children; its original test checks structural keys, never child success. This is explicitly historical aggregate retirement, not accepted current release proof.",
    "Review aggregate cannot remain callable after its temporal/phi/instinct producers retire. Paper13 qualified owner adapter and independent deep-agents source/test remain untouched."
  ],
  "limits": [
    "No originals or products run for this historical proposal. No new Runtime behavioral qualification or child pass claimed.",
    "Original assertions and current caller repair preimages preserved exactly; historical milestone evidence unchanged.",
    "Retiring original shell acceptance here is explicit historical-contract disposition requiring independent review, not inferred proof from archival custody."
  ],
